{"type":"standard","title":"Troy Jackson","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Troy Jackson</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q7846807","titles":{"canonical":"Troy_Jackson","normalized":"Troy Jackson","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Troy Jackson</span></span>"},"pageid":33097080,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Troy_Jackson_in_the_Senate_Chamber_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Troy_Jackson_in_the_Senate_Chamber_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/Troy_Jackson_in_the_Senate_Chamber_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1471,"height":1962},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378303886","tid":"0372524e-bf78-11f1-b699-a68027cf3390","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:16:00Z","description":"American politician and logger (born 1968)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troy_Jackson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troy_Jackson?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troy_Jackson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Troy_Jackson"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troy_Jackson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Troy_Jackson","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troy_Jackson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Troy_Jackson"}},"extract":"Troy Dale Jackson is an American politician and logger. He served in the Maine Senate from 2008 to 2014 and from 2016 to 2024, representing parts of northern Aroostook County. He was the Senate president and majority leader from 2018 to 2024. A member of the Democratic Party, he is the party's nominee for the 2026 United States Senate election in Maine.","extract_html":"<p><b>Troy Dale Jackson</b> is an American politician and logger. He served in the Maine Senate from 2008 to 2014 and from 2016 to 2024, representing parts of northern Aroostook County. He was the Senate president and majority leader from 2018 to 2024. A member of the Democratic Party, he is the party's nominee for the 2026 United States Senate election in Maine.</p>"}